WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:03.060
<i>At last the land is plunged into chaos,</i>

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:06.020
<i>and the distinct scent of battle fills the air.</i>

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.190
<i>In the face of uncertain future,</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:13.400
<i>Tokugawa Keiichiro, the illegitimate child 
of the Shogun's line, is also uncertain,</i>

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.580
<i>and trembling as the very 
soul of truth is revealed...</i>

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.150
<i>Or he should be, at least.</i>

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.270
No, Keiichiro-sama!

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.960
Why not?

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.790
Just let me kiss you one more time!

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.080
You just said that was the last one...

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.550
Just one more time!

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.900
The last one wasn't deep enough! 
And it was too short!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.730
We can't go all the way, anyway.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:33.800
You mustn't.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.960
Just one more. Come on, Kiriko!

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.180
Okay? Okay?!

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.500
No, you can't...

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:41.460
W-Wait.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:44.390
Please wait.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.690
I need to talk to you.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.440
A-About what?

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.490
It's about Susanoo.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:56.570
Crap!

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:59.750
I was supposed to prepare the 
pomelo bath we're starting today!

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.120
Keiichiro-sama?

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.540
Crap! Crap!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.540
Grannie's gonna kill me!

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.500
Keiichiro-sama...

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:16.760
So the demon still hasn't 
taken over this boy, huh?

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:22.280
And the same goes for you...

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:33.650
<b>Dai Shogun</b>

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:33.650
Great Revolution

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:56.590
<b>Episode 9:
Cherry Blossoms Bath Love Stories</b>

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:56.650
Why can't you pilot Susanoo, you ask?

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.920
Yes.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:03.560
Both Chiharu and Hyogo-dono have been 
able to pilot Susanoo with Keiichiro-sama.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.870
Why I am the only one who hasn't been chosen?

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:14.750
Susanoo seems to decide who will 
pilot it only once the battle starts.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:24.180
And that idiot's feelings might 
have something to do with it, too.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:28.970
So Keiichiro-sama isn't choosing me, then?

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:34.080
You should know that better than anyone.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:36.980
You're his girlfriend now, right?

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.490
I don't know.

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.490
You don't know?

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:45.770
Huh?

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.950
I'll say it again.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:51.590
I, Hyakusuke, have fallen madly 
in love with you, Chiharu-san!

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:56.710
I know I'm just a wimpy kid, 
but please go out with me!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.080
Wh-What are you saying?

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.470
My body and heart belong to Kei-chan!

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:05.630
I know that.

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:08.200
Even if you love the boss, I don't care.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.470
Please, be my woman.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.980
<b>Pillow</b>

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.980
<b>Moron</b>

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.980
Don't be stupid!

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.810
Wh-Who'd want to be the 
woman of a guy like you?

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:21.030
Not a chance! I refuse!

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.340
What will you do?

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.730
What if you end up ruling Japan?

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.030
I don't know about all that complicated stuff.

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:54.100
But I won't pretend to ignore it like I have so far.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.440
I'll face my problems 
head-on and destroy them!

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:58.940
Is that your answer?

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.400
Damn it.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.660
<b>Cherry Blossom Baths</b>

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.320
What's wrong, Boss?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.080
N-Nothing!

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.700
What about you? Did something happen?

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:16.710
My heart feels like ice.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.250
What does that mean?

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:22.210
You don't understand what 
it's like to be unpopular.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:26.220
The feeling that my heart's 
been trampled on and crushed...

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.410
Come with me, Hyakusuke!

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:43.200
What's going on, Boss?

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.780
Just come with me!

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:53.700
I have no idea what he's thinking.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:58.670
Yeah. What the heck is he thinking?

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:02.960
If only he would tell me how he feels...

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.130
No, I wish he hadn't told me.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:09.510
It hurts to just leave things as they are.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.850
I think I wanted to keep things as they were.

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.810
I don't understand.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:16.810
I don't understand.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:27.740
Hey, Hyakusuke, this is the best girl yet!

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:31.450
Boss, I'm not in the mood...

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.440
Just shut up and look!

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:35.700
Look through this and you'll 
forget your problems.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:39.040
Th-This is...

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.000
Well?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.000
A-Amazing...

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.970
I'm sure it is amazing.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.390
Honestly, men are so...

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.810
Did you get the pomelo bath ready?

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:57.240
Crap!

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.060
Hold it, you idiot!

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.800
What's wrong, Grannie?

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.740
You look depressed, sweetie.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.560
You're thinking about a man, aren't you?

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:19.790
H-How did you—

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:23.390
You're worried because you 
don't know what he's thinking.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:24.830
Right?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.250
How could you tell?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.760
Why not tell me about it?

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.970
Wh-What?

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:40.230
It's lonely sitting in the bath all by myself.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:50.580
How could I hurt my hip at a time like this?

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.610
What a disgrace.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:55.120
You've been so busy lately.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.370
You pushed yourself too hard.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:07:59.160
Keiichiro.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.040
What?

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.000
Go have a talk with Kiriko.

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:05.000
I know!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.240
More importantly, 
don't worry about the bathhouse.

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:10.210
You stay put and rest!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.640
Let's go, Hyakusuke!

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:12.780
Right!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.860
I see.

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:21.640
So he won't tell you how he feels.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.520
That must make you uneasy.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.270
Yes.

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:31.570
If he'd only tell me, at least a little...

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:32.860
That's probably not happening.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:38.390
Men won't feed a fish after they've caught it.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:42.860
And they don't even notice that 
the fish keeps getting weaker.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:47.830
So the fish has to go get food itself.

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.840
What do you mean?

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:53.260
If he won't tell you, you go tell him.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:57.510
"I love you and admire you," you say.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.720
I can't say that!

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:02.470
You're so naïve...

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.150
Come gather 'round, everyone!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:12.960
The Cherry Blossom Baths' own 
Boss Keiichiro is about to speak!

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.680
Hey, everyone!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:18.660
Today, we've got a rare pomelo bath.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.680
You'll warm up the second you get in.

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.860
It'll warm you right to your bones!

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:25.370
And for girls, it'll make your skin silky smooth!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.290
Okay! The room's all set up.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:34.800
What's next, Hyakusuke?

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.520
Right! Next we stoke the fires 
and chop more wood!

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:38.720
Which will you do?

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.070
Both, of course!

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:44.640
Or so I'd like to say, but it'd be 
faster to split up, right, Hyakusuke?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.020
Right, I'm on it!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.480
That's Kei-chan stoking the fires.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.530
No point in worrying.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.700
I'll have Kei-chan make me feel better!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.920
Kei-chan!

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:11.070
All right!

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.840
Keiichiro-sama.

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.420
Kiriko!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:17.920
I'm busy now! Let's talk later!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.320
Please wait.

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:21.180
Wh-Wh-Wh-What?

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.890
Please let me pilot Susanoo with you.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.130
I want to...

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:36.360
How do you feel about me, Keiichiro-sama?

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.700
Please tell me your feelings.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.700
Do you love Kiriko?

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:45.370
You like that hot girl?

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.910
<i>What is with everyone...</i>

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:51.790
I want to go to Edo with you.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:04.260
Um, if I'm bothering you, I'll go.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:12.310
Stay here.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.360
Okay.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.360
I don't understand.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:21.030
I don't understand how I feel.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.030
I love Kei-chan.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:30.000
So why do I feel awkward when I'm with 
you, and why does my heart ache?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.000
You dummy!

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.420
Chiharu-san...

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:37.550
What did you say?

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.420
I'm sorry. I won't go to Edo yet.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.430
What do you mean?

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:46.300
I can't abandon the Cherry Blossom Baths.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.640
That comes before the rest of the country.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:54.730
But if Shigeyoshi takes over Japan, 
Nagasaki won't come out unscathed.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.190
Shut up.

00:11:56.670 --> 00:12:00.280
How can I rule Japan if I can't care 
for the people right in front of me?

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:17.400
I may need to get a little rough.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:45.780
I heard what he said. Sorry about that idiot.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.030
No...

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.660
It's nothing new.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:52.560
Whenever it comes down to it, he gets scared.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:59.590
He tells himself that he can't hold anything 
bigger than he can fit in his hand.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:10.180
About what I said...

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.680
I'm sorry, Chiharu-san.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:17.270
If you're going to apologize, you never 
should've said it in the first place.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:23.020
But you wouldn't know how 
I felt if I didn't tell you.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:27.360
I couldn't just leave things 
up in the air forever.

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:31.910
The boss always tells me to 
do things instead of worrying.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.580
I don't regret it.

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:38.290
Dummy.

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:40.250
I'm sorry.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.140
Don't apologize.

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:46.930
Chiharu-san!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.280
Chiharu-san!

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:09.780
Chiharu-san!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.870
Chiharu-san!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.160
Chiharu-san!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:44.480
I'll destroy everything you love, boy.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.240
That bitch!

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:15.070
Come on, little virgin boy.

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:17.270
Come out from your nice, lukewarm bath.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.980
Let me in, Kei-chan!

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.650
Keiichiro, pick me!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:27.680
No.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:29.480
Kiriko!

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:31.740
Keiichiro-sama!

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.180
Kiriko!

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.620
Susanoo will let you in.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:38.870
I want to pilot it with you.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:47.920
Susanoo, please let me be 
by Keiichiro-sama's side!

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.140
Keiichiro-sama!

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:58.220
Yeah!

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:27.250
<b>Susanoo Heavenly Thunder God</b>

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:30.690
Kei-chan!

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:31.800
Kiriko-dono!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:34.920
Finally.

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.760
I've been waiting.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.270
Kiriko, this might not be the 
answer you're looking for...

00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:45.560
But I want to be with you more than anyone.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.270
When I pilot Susanoo, and when I go to Edo!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:50.840
So...

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.490
So believe in me!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:54.200
Right!

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:57.700
Now, come and get me!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:04.200
What's wrong? Too scared to move?

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:07.380
Are you satisfied with that?

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:10.340
Is that the fish food you were looking for?

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:13.010
You're the girl from before?

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.400
But it's not enough.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:21.720
That lukewarm love of yours will 
never be enough to defeat Shigeyoshi.

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:28.940
Woman, you haven't helped the boy at all.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:30.720
What?

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.980
What did you say?

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.360
What do you know?

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.400
Shut up, kid!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:40.830
I care for Keiichiro-sama more 
than anyone, more than anything!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:46.500
Then how come you didn't 
realize what's bothering him?

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:51.200
He's worried.

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:53.800
Whenever it comes time to talk 
about fighting Shigeyoshi,

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.830
his heart shrinks and his feet freeze in place.

00:17:56.830 --> 00:18:00.350
He wants to stay in this nice, 
lukewarm bath forever.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:05.000
But you didn't even realize that.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:09.500
All you could do was complain that 
he didn't understand how you felt.

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:14.700
In the end, your own feelings are 
more important than his problems.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.690
That's not true...

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:21.220
That's why you were never able 
to pilot Susanoo until now.

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:25.370
On some level, the boy 
recognized your selfishness.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.240
That's not true.

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:31.650
No, you believe, deep down in your heart,

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.930
that you don't need her.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.880
He doesn't need me?

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.520
No...

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:59.810
Love is only true when you 
don't want anything in return.

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:03.720
Your love is filthy, and selfish.

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:06.740
You only slow the boy down.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:11.960
Just leave him and go, right now.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.520
That's what's best for him.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.090
Shut up!

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:19.300
Kiriko, ignore her.

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.260
Shut up!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.520
Shut up!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.680
Shut up!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.610
Shut up!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:39.900
Kiriko!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.740
What's wrong, Susanoo?!

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:46.950
Move! Move, damn it!

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:53.710
What?

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.730
At last, the demon has awakened!

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.600
What's wrong, Susanoo?!

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.610
Stupid thing... It's not doing what I tell it!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.370
Stop!

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:30.330
Damn it, Susanoo!

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.290
Do what I tell you, damn it!

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:36.270
Stop it! Stop!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.160
Stop!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:41.170
Susanoo, stop!

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:45.810
Susanoo!

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:47.010
Stop!

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:48.580
Damn it!

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:58.090
Stop!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.280
Keiichiro-sama!

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:24.980
Keiichiro-sama?

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:34.640
Keiichiro-sama!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:40.020
The priestess's hatred has finally blossomed.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:43.690
I love the sound of the screaming demons.

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:46.400
More! More!

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:49.450
Entertain me even more!

00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:29.110
The boss is down, and the 
Shinsengumi are attacking!

00:23:29.110 --> 00:23:31.450
I won't give up! I'll fight for Kei-chan!

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:33.140
But Kiriko-san ran away.

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.600
What?! That cold-blooded 
woman is going to betray us?

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.420
